  "final_span": "broadcast on Fox Sports Detroit-plus, and the next three home games \u2013 against Columbus, Los Angeles and Anaheim \u2013 are being broadcast on FSD-plus over the next four days.\nMike Green expresses satisfaction with his swift comeback to the Wings following his groin injury. He scored three points (one goal and two assists) in his first two games and demonstrated in Sunday's win against the Stars that he plays solidly defensively as well. His performance in the transition game has particularly stood out in terms of speed.\nBlashill stated that there are no duration restrictions for Green to play once he is fit again.\nBlashill has likewise discovered an vintage NHL memento in Green: a lost stick during transitional play. Green is the lone player in camp to successfully break away from defenseman Dennis Cholowski and make a standout breakout at the North Farm Credit Union Center. The right-handed Green is taking left-",
